flowchart TD
    A[User Query] --> B{Need internal data or action?}

    B -- No: general advice --> C[Baseline Chatbot Path]
    C --> C1[LLM answers from prompt only]
    C1 --> Z[Final Answer]

    B -- Yes: CV/JD/schedule/action --> D[ReAct Agent Path]
    D --> E[Build prompt with tool registry and scratchpad]
    E --> F[LLM Provider returns Thought + Action or Final Answer]
    F --> G{Parser result}

    G -- Final Answer --> Z
    G -- Malformed or missing Action/Final --> H[Add error Observation]
    H --> I{Reached MAX_ITERATIONS?}

    G -- Action parsed --> J{Tool name in registry?}
    J -- No --> K[Observation: UNKNOWN_TOOL]
    K --> I

    J -- Yes --> L{Repeated same tool + args?}
    L -- Yes --> M[Observation: REPEATED_ACTION, do not execute twice]
    M --> I

    L -- No --> N{Side-effect tool?}
    N -- schedule_interview --> O{confirmed == true?}
    O -- No --> P[Observation: NEED_CONFIRMATION, no mutation]
    O -- Yes --> Q[Validate args and execute mock/in-memory booking]

    N -- read/check/evaluate tool --> R[Validate args and execute pure tool]

    Q --> S[Observation from tool]
    R --> S
    P --> S

    S --> T[Append Thought/Action/Observation to scratchpad]
    T --> I
    I -- No --> E
    I -- Yes --> U[Safe fallback answer]
    U --> Z

    Z --> V[Show answer and trace for demo/evaluation]
